window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-30f6f1f685b6e340"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"finance\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">财务</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>基于财务模型和经营数据开展分析、审阅并汇报结果。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex，将经过批准的工作簿、仪表板、模型和负责人提供的背景信息整理成可供审阅的分析与报告。ChatGPT 可以清楚呈现公式、来源、假设和待确认问题，让财务负责人在分享内容前运用自己的专业判断。</p> <p><a id=\"explain-performance\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">解释业绩表现</h2> <p>根据财务结账数据撰写管理层说明，将实际结果与计划进行比较，并找出造成重大变化的主要因素。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/monthly-business-review-narrative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备业务回顾（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供 KPI 仪表板、结账工作簿、指标定义、预测更新和以往……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/budget-vs-actuals-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">审查预算与实际结果（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供预算、实际数据导出和结账说明，然后让它将实际结果对应到计划……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/variance-driver-bridge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">搭建差异驱动因素桥接分析（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供实际结果、预算、预测、KPI 数据、阈值和负责人说明，然后让它……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"review-models-and-plans\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">审查模型和计划</h2> <p>构建或检查财务模型、更新预测并比较不同情景，同时保留所有假设和数据来源缺口。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/finance-model-cleanup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">清理并审查财务模型（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供财务模型及其支持来源，然后让它安全地清理……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/dcf-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">建立贴现现金流（DCF）估值模型（本地尚未收录）</a>：附上历史财务数据、估值假设和建模说明，再让 ChatGPT……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cash-flow-forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">预测现金流（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供现金流输入和模型约束，然后让它创建可编辑的……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-forecast-and-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">更新预测与计划（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供运营模型、最新实际结果、经批准的假设和负责人输入……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"prepare-leadership-reporting\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">准备管理层报告</h2> <p>根据经批准的进展跟踪表、指标、说明和负责人提供的信息，准备周期性的公司、管理层、首席财务官或董事会报告材料包。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cfo-board-reporting-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备管理层报告材料包（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供上一版报告、进度大纲、项目跟踪表、KPI 和预测输入……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"finance\">Finance</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Build, review, and report from financial models and operating data.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to turn approved workbooks, dashboards, models, and owner context into reviewable analysis and reporting artifacts. ChatGPT can keep formulas, sources, assumptions, and open questions visible so finance owners can apply judgment before anything is shared.</p> <h2 id=\"explain-performance\">Explain performance</h2> <p>Turn close data into a leadership narrative, compare results with plan, and rank the drivers behind material movements.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/monthly-business-review-narrative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare a business review (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT KPI dashboards, close workbooks, metric definitions, forecast updates, prior...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/budget-vs-actuals-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review budget vs. actuals (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT a budget, actuals export, and close notes, then ask it to map actuals to plan...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/variance-driver-bridge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build a variance driver bridge (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT actuals, budget, forecasts, KPI data, thresholds, and owner notes, then ask it...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"review-models-and-plans\">Review models and plans</h2> <p>Build or inspect financial models, refresh forecasts, and compare scenarios without hiding assumptions or source gaps.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/finance-model-cleanup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clean and review a financial model (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT a financial model and its supporting sources, then ask it to make safe cleanup...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/dcf-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model a DCF valuation (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Attach historical financials, valuation assumptions, and modeling notes, then ask ChatGPT...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cash-flow-forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Forecast cash flow (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT cash-flow inputs and model constraints, then ask it to create an editable...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-forecast-and-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refresh a forecast and plan (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT an operating model, latest actuals, approved assumptions, owner inputs, and...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"prepare-leadership-reporting\">Prepare leadership reporting</h2> <p>Prepare a recurring company, leadership, CFO, or board pack from approved progress trackers, metrics, commentary, and owner inputs.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cfo-board-reporting-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare a leadership reporting pack (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT the prior pack, progress outline, initiative trackers, KPI and forecast inputs...</li> </ul>"};
